   - 1 foot = 1 m/3.378
   - 1 m = 3.378 ft
   - 1 inch = 0.0254 m
   - 3 ft = 3 × 0.3 m = 0.9 m
   - 6 in = 6 × 0.0254 m = 0.1542 m
