The question is $\boxed{\text{Yes, MCT supplementation may help weight loss in obese individuals on a calorie-reduced diet, but the exact effect is not as significant than initially hypothesized, and supplementation at 24% of total calories is likely necessary to achieve a positive effect.}}$
