The enthalpy change for the reaction can be calculated using the following equation:

ΔH = ΔH_hydration - ΔH_formation

where ΔH_hydration is the sum of the hydration enthalpies of the reactants and Cl-, and ΔH_formation is the enthalpy of formation of the product [FeCl4]2-.

