The correct relationship is:
\[
v(t) = \frac{d}{dt} V(t) = \frac{dV}{dt}
\]
\[
i(t) = \frac{V}{C} \implies V(t) = C i(t)
\]
Substituting \( i(t) = 0.2e^{-4t} \):
\[
V(t) = C \times 0.2e^{-4t} = 0.2C e^{-4t}
