\[
\Delta p = P_f - P_i = (E_f/c - E_i/c) \mathbf{p}_f - \mathbf{p}_i
\]  
The square of the momentum transfer is:  
\[
(\Delta p)^2 = (E_f/c - E_I/c)^2 + (P_i - P_f)^2
\]  
The magnitude of the momentum transfer is:  
\[
