\[
\Delta p = \sqrt{p_i^2 + p_f^2 - 2 p_i p_f \cos \theta}
\]  
The square of the momentum transfer \( Q^2 \) is given by:  
\[
Q^2 = (p_f - p_i)^2
\]  
The magnitude of the momentum transfer is:  
\[
\langle Q^2 \rangle = \frac{1}{\sqrt{2}} \left( \frac{1}{2} \left( p_f^2 + p_i^2 \right) - p_f p_i \cos \theta \right)
\]  
