Subtract equation (1) from equation (2):
\[
\ln k_2 - \ln k_1 = \left( \frac{E_a}{RT_2} - \frac{E_a}{RT_1} \right)
\]
\[
\ln \left( \frac{k_2}{k_1} \right) = A e^{-E_a / RT_2} - A e^{-E_a / RT_1}
\]
\[
\ln \left( \frac{k_2}{k_1} \right) = \frac{E_a}{RT_2} - \frac{E_a}{RT_1}
