     - \( P_0 = 1.0 \, \text{bar} = 10^5 \, \text{Pa} \)
     - \( V_f = 1.0 \, \text{L} \)
     - \( V_0 = 1.0 \, \text{L} \)
     - \( R = 8.314 \, \text{J/mol·K} \)
     - \( T = 298 \, \text{K} \)
